    "### Molecular Analysis and the PSREQ Pathway\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Molecule 1: **C\\(14\\)H\\(19\\)Mg\\(2\\)N\\(3\\)O\\(6\\)Zn\\(2\\)+8**\n",
