    "3. **Dynamic Noise Filtering (DNF):** Reduces prediction errors.  \n",
    "   \\[\n",
    "   N(t) = \\sum \\frac{\\Delta N_i}{1 + k \\cdot |\\Delta N_i|}\n",
    "   \\]\n",
