    "\n",
    "#### **Phase 5: Iterative Refinement**\n",
    "1. Integrate feedback loops (\\(Z_{\\text{epi}}, Y_{\\text{edit}}\\)) to correct errors.\n",
    "2. Apply **Entropy Reallocation (ERM)** to address noise-induced inaccuracies.\n",
